WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.149 --> 00:00:11.559
Most people in the 18th century only had a
proper wash twice a year.

00:00:11.559 --> 00:00:17.180
Finding Nemo, a movie about the suffering
of a captured clownfish, ironically caused

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:21.539
home aquarium demand for them to triple.

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:27.359
The first baseball gloves were flesh-coloured
in case spectators noticed and accused players

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:29.750
of cowardice.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.190
Only a fifth of the Sahara desert is sand.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.750
The rest consists of mainly gravel.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:43.550
In 2007, a woman collapsed and lay on the
E.R floor of Martin Luther King Jr.-Harbor

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:49.710
Hospital in Los Angeles for 45 minutes as
hospital staff ignored her.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:54.050
A janitor mopped the floor around her as she
vomited blood.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:01:00.770
She was then arrested by police for causing
a disturbance and died on the stretcher.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:06.650
Take-out restaurants existed in ancient Rome,
with service counters opening onto the street

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.370
to pick up food.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:14.330
More than 200 existed in Pompeii, and most
of its homes lacked dining or kitchen areas,

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:17.720
suggesting that cooking at home was unusual.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:22.540
To improve their ability to swallow hot dogs,
the International Federation of Competitive

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.190
Eating is studying black holes.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:30.890
As a boy, Roald Dahl taste-tested new chocolate
bars for Cadbury's.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:35.740
80% of all food has sugar added to it.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:40.720
It would cost the US government less money
to provide homes to the homeless than it does

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:43.560
to leave them on the street.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:49.750
It is as difficult for a bacterium to swim
through water as it is for a human to swim

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.549
through syrup.

00:01:51.549 --> 00:01:56.440
The first Atomic bomb dropped on Japan was
assembled while the aircraft was actually

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.740
in flight.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:02.960
This was done to avoid detonation while taking
off because bombers kept crashing and burning

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:03.960
on the runway.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.580
It took them 25 minutes to assemble the weapon
while in flight.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:15.359
As a nuclear safety inspector, Homer Simpson
earns $20,000 more than the average American.

00:02:15.359 --> 00:02:22.950
In the 19th century, circumcision was used
to treat epilepsy, hernias, lunacy and paralysis.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:34.040
The last film rented out by Blockbuster was
the 2013 comedy This Is the End.

